.TH CCENV 1 "2026-04-30" "ccenv 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ccenv \- profile manager and usage analytics for Claude Code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ccenv
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ name ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ccenv
manages multiple Claude Code provider profiles and tracks token usage and cost across sessions.
.PP
Each profile is a TOML file under
.I ~/.config/ccenv/profiles/
containing the environment variables needed to point Claude Code at an Anthropic-compatible API.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B ccenv
Launch claude with an interactive profile picker (arrow keys to select, Enter to confirm).
.TP
.BI "ccenv " name
Switch to
.I name
and launch claude.
.TP
.BI "ccenv add " name
Create a new profile interactively. Prompts for provider, model, auth token, and optional description.
.TP
.BI "ccenv use " name
Switch the current profile without launching claude.
.TP
.B ccenv ls
List all profiles. Current profile is marked with
.BR * .
.TP
.B ccenv current
Show the current profile name and effective environment variables.
.TP
.BI "ccenv rm " name
Delete a profile.
.TP
.BI "ccenv edit [" name ]
Open a profile file in
.BR $EDITOR .
Defaults to the current profile.
.TP
.B ccenv stats
Show token usage and cost from Claude Code session logs.
.TP
.B ccenv man
Open this man page.
.SH STATS OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "--by " dimension
Group by
.BR profile " (default), " model ", or " project .
.TP
.BI "--since " window
Time window:
.BR 7d ", " 30d ", " 90d ", " 365d ", or " YYYY-MM-DD .
.TP
.BI "--profile " name
Filter to a single profile.
.TP
.B --json
Machine-readable JSON output.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Profiles are stored in
.IR ~/.config/ccenv/profiles/ .
The current profile name is stored in
.IR ~/.config/ccenv/current .
.PP
Profile files use TOML format:
.PP
.RS
.nf
description = "My provider"

[env]
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL = "https://api.example.com"
ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN = "${MY_API_KEY}"
ANTHROPIC_MODEL = "model-name"
.fi
.RE
.PP
.B ${ENV_VAR}
placeholders in
.B auth_token
are resolved from the shell environment at launch time.
.SH BUILT-IN PROVIDERS
.TS
l l l.
Provider	Type	Base URL
_
volcengine	Coding Plan	ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/coding
bailian	Coding Plan	coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/apps/anthropic
deepseek	standard	api.deepseek.com
bailing	standard	openrouter.ai/api
mimo	standard	token-plan-cn.xiaomimimo.com/anthropic
.TE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ccenv/profiles/*.toml
Profile files.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ccenv/current
Current profile name (plain text).
.TP
.I ~/.config/ccenv/sessions.jsonl
Session log for stats fallback.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ccenv/stats.cache.json
Incremental stats cache.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
# Set a token and go
export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY="sk-..."
ccenv deepseek

# Interactive picker
ccenv

# See token usage
ccenv stats --since 7d

# Create a custom profile
ccenv add my-provider
.fi
